## @file
# Keypad Driver.
#
# Produces SimpleTextIn / SimpleTextInEx on any handle carrying
# KEYPAD_DEVICE_PROTOCOL, polling it from a 20 ms periodic timer.
# Ported verbatim from HtcLeoPkg (QSD8250Pkg).
